CLAUDE.md
# Local research tooling — Python scrapers + their generated data.
# Kept out of git so the repo stays focused on the Rust engine.
# (Directory itself is allowed so we can carve out specific tools below.)
/scripts/*
# Carve out the parity audit tool — it's pure analysis (no local data
# side effects) and is referenced from Codex briefs, so it needs to
# live in the repo proper.
!/scripts/audit_skill_gaps.py
# Rule-provenance + primitive-coverage diagnostics — same rationale.
!/scripts/rule_provenance.py
!/scripts/primitive_coverage.py
!/scripts/primitive_audit.py
# Local research / scratch markdown files at repo root — working
# notes, briefs, investigation logs. Kept out of git so the repo
# stays focused on the Rust engine.
/_*.md
!/scripts/condition_scope_discovery.py
# Skill walker — pairs prydwen description with parsed conditions/
# behaviors + wiring status. Lets us read "what should this skill do?"
# next to "what is the engine actually doing?" without code-grepping.
!/scripts/skill_walk.py
!/scripts/generate_default_handlers.py
